      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-02T10:23:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shouldn\u0027t this check if P is a prime with the required characteristics? And G ? \n\nAdam, Filippo,\n\ncan a cryptographer comment here?",
      "revId": "1e7b6908c39e0c2b537de14c038bcf029a1f4575",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
